+/* riscos-crossdev (as its GCC 10.2 toolchain, 1.11/1.12): -pthread links
+   libpthread (UnixLib has the threads; libpthread.a is empty); a mixed
+   program (-rdynamic) also links libstdc++ and libm, and the whole of
+   UnixLib, exported, unless -no-whole-unixlib.  */
